{
  "_doc": {
      "about": "Todos on an email: the todo holds only its text; whether it is done, snoozed, pinned or in the inbox is its email's. Its doc id is its thread id, so an email has at most one (shared/src/todos/linked.ts, Android :core todo/Linked.kt). Run by shared/src/todos/linked.spec.ts and Android :core LinkedTodoFixturesTest.",
      "todos": "Every todo is `base` with the listed fields replaced; times are epoch milliseconds.",
      "read": "isEmailTodoDoc(data): whether the stored doc is a todo on an email; when it is, readEmailTodo(id, data, now) is `todo`.",
      "fields": "emailTodoFields(newEmailTodo(threadId, text, now)): every field a write stores (the store adds serverModifiedAt).",
      "text": "withEmailTodoText(todo, text): its text after; modifiedAt waits for the edit to end.",
      "ended": "emailTodoEditEnded(todo, startText, now): `todo` as editing it ends, `startText` its text when editing began (null for one new in this edit); changed text stamps modifiedAt, once.",
      "delete": "withEmailTodoDeleted(todo, now): a tombstone, text blanked.",
      "row": "rowEmailTodo(emailTodosByThread(todos), threadIds): the id of the todo a row of these Gmail threads (lead first) shows, or null; tombstones show nowhere.",
      "edit": "emailTodoToEdit(emailTodosByThread(todos), threadIds, now): the id Add todo opens, and whether it is a new one (on the lead)."
  },
